          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list07\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Questions\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\" selected>5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Color</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Item\" name=\"items\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                        <b>My Work</b></h5>\n                    <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Some of my professional, academic, and personal endeavours.</h6>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0009-0001-1257-0428\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Orcid ID</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-8\">\n                <div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n                    <div class=\"card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Personal Perspectives</b></h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">Some of my medium articles that describe my experience as an autistic leader.</p><p><br><br></p><p>-&gt;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://medium.com/@trevorjsemeniuk/i-am-autistic-14db0524a60b\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b><i>I Am Autistic</i></b></a><br><br>-&gt;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://medium.com/@trevorjsemeniuk/the-world-through-an-autistic-lens-de8821ee0247\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>The World Through an Autistic Lens</b></a><a href=\"https://medium.com/@trevorjsemeniuk/the-world-through-an-autistic-lens-de8821ee0247\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b><br></b></a><br><b>-&gt;</b>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://medium.com/@trevorjsemeniuk/autism-adhd-and-stimulant-medication-a-personal-perspective-e297b06eb71d\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\" style><b>Autism, Adhd, and Stimulant Medication</b></a><br><br>-&gt; <b><a href=\"https://medium.com/@trevorjsemeniuk/from-high-school-drop-out-to-senior-military-officer-d76fb49734cf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">F<b>rom High School Drop Out to Senior Military Officer: </b></a><br><a href=\"https://medium.com/@trevorjsemeniuk/from-high-school-drop-out-to-senior-military-officer-d76fb49734cf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">The Unlikely Life Path of a Complex Autistic in a Complicated World</a><a href=\"https://medium.com/@trevorjsemeniuk/autism-adhd-and-stimulant-medication-a-personal-perspective-e297b06eb71d\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><br></a></b><a href=\"https://medium.com/@trevorjsemeniuk/autism-adhd-and-stimulant-medication-a-personal-perspective-e297b06eb71d\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b><i><br></i></b></a></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\"><b>Research &amp; Publications&nbsp;</b></h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\"><br><a href=\"https://leadingwithautism.com/Files/Autism_Leadership_and_the_Canadian_Armed_Forces-TrevorJSemeniuk.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i><b>Autism, Leadership and The Canadian Armed Forces</b></i></a><br><b><br></b>This paper aims to offer a comprehensive understanding of the intersection of autism and leadership, identify research gaps, and demonstrate the significant potential for autistic leaders to contribute to resolving complex national defence problems.<br><br><i><b><a href=\"https://leadingwithautism.com/Files/Autism_and_Leadership-LCol%20_Trevor_Semeniuk.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b><i></i></b></a><b><i><a href=\"https://prezi.com/view/toD1RaTvbeS0nwBOUgll/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Bilingual</a></i></b><i><b><a href=\"https://prezi.com/view/toD1RaTvbeS0nwBOUgll/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"> </a></b></i><b><i><a href=\"https://prezi.com/view/toD1RaTvbeS0nwBOUgll/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Presentation</a></i></b><br></b></i><br><b>------------</b><br><b><br></b><i><b><a href=\"http://www.leadingwithautism.com/Files/Character-based_Leadership_Approaches_for_Autistic_Members_of_the_Canadian_Armed_Forces.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i><b>Character-based Leadership Approaches</b></i>&nbsp;</a></b></i><i><b><a href=\"http://www.leadingwithautism.com/Files/Character-based_Leadership_Approaches_for_Autistic_Members_of_the_Canadian_Armed_Forces.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i><b>for Autistic </b></i></a></b></i><br><i><b><a href=\"http://www.leadingwithautism.com/Files/Character-based_Leadership_Approaches_for_Autistic_Members_of_the_Canadian_Armed_Forces.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i><b>Members of the Canadian Armed Forces</b></i></a></b></i><br><br>Despite an established presence of autistic leaders in the CAF, efforts to support and fully integrate these individuals are lacking, thus further study is necessary to determine the appropriate support and enabling conditions for success. This paper postulates that character-based leadership (CBL) could be a suitable leadership theory for CAF leadership development programs that incorporate autistic perspectives.<i><b><a href=\"http://www.leadingwithautism.com/Files/Character-based_Leadership_Approaches_for_Autistic_Members_of_the_Canadian_Armed_Forces.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i><b><br></b></i></a></b></i><br><a href=\"https://www.leadingwithautism.com/Files/Character-based Leadership_Approaches_for_the_CAF-Bilingual_Presentation-TrevorJSemeniuk.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b><i>Bilingual Presentation</i></b></a><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\"><b>Advocacy Initiatives</b></h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\"><i>Some of my other projects and advocacy efforts</i><br><br><b>-&gt;<a href=\"https://prezi.com/view/R81WRWj3lzgCThQuonU0/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Autism and Pathological Demand Avoidance</b></a></b><br><b><br>-&gt;&nbsp;<b><a href=\"https://prezi.com/view/KLKBBU50Oy83VMkQMPnO/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Character-based Leadership </b></a><br><a href=\"https://prezi.com/view/KLKBBU50Oy83VMkQMPnO/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>approaches for the Canadian Armed Forces</b></a></b></b><b><b><a href=\"https://prezi.com/view/KLKBBU50Oy83VMkQMPnO/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b><br></b></a></b></b><b><b><a href=\"https://prezi.com/view/KLKBBU50Oy83VMkQMPnO/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><br></a></b></b><b><b>-&gt;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.leadingwithautism.com/Files/Leadership Influence According to Trevor Semeniuk.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Views on Leadership Influence</b></a></b></b><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\"><b>Gardening</b></h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">My thesis and a conference paper produced during my MASc in Electrical Engineering, titled, <i>\"A Systematic Approach to Feature Selection for Encrypted Network Traffic Classification\"</i><br><br><a href=\"https://leadingwithautism.com/Files/A_Systematic_Approach_To_Feature_Selection_For_Encrypted_Network_Traffic_Classification-TrevorJSemeniuk.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b><i>Thesis</i></b></a><br><br><a href=\"https://leadingwithautism.com/Files/Syscon_2018_Encrypted_Feature_Selection-TrevorJSemeniuk.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i><b>Paper</b></i></a><br> <br><a href=\"https://leadingwithautism.com/Files/2018_IEEE_SysCon_Presentation-TrevorJSemeniuk.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i><b>Presentation</b></i></a><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\"><b>\n                                    Music</b></h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">I have a profound special interest in music. Music is therapy for me and it helps me in my mental health journey.&nbsp; This includes listening, playing, discussing, analyzing, and creating various styles of music.&nbsp; <br><br>As a musical artist I play guitar, drums, bass guitar, piano, harmonica, ukulele, and practically any other object that can produce a sound and I can make music. As such, I created a half-joke, half-serious, semi-professional, semi-talented, hardly&nbsp; band called The Four Trevors,<br><br><br><br><br>Some of my music:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/TrevorSemeniuk\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a> &amp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/thefourtrevors/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 5\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse6\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\"><b>My Family</b></h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse6\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    My Pets<br><br><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
